1
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:05,800
Congratulations on your engagement, Your Highness.

2
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:09,740
You have chosen quite the wonderful partner.

3
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:17,500
<i>At the time, I was at my wit's end.
Who I would marry was the problem.</i>

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,900
That sly old tanuki! He's so shameless...

5
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,630
Uncle!

6
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:27,090
These teaching materials were very good.

7
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:31,590
Aren't they? Dr. Rezzi's books are very popular.

8
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:32,850
If you'll excuse me...

9
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:35,100
Chris.

10
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,690
I think you're just angry.

11
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:42,230
The lady of Miseral would be
an ideal princess, don't you think?

12
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:47,240
You should be stepping away
from your childhood attachments now.

13
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:51,960
Uncle, I know that.

14
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,370
But… still…

15
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:59,940
The feelings that I have toward Eli
aren't like what I have for other girls.

16
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,250
Chris…

17
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,260
A book market?

18
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:15,470
This is the place...

19
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:19,650
I want to go to a book market.

20
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:25,440
It's a market that sells books the Stars of Thistle has,
and it only opens once every three years.

21
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:34,820
<i>That's where I encountered Dr. Rezzi.</i>

22
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:39,860
Nikola Rezzi? Unbelievable,
that's the same name as on the book...

23
00:01:40,670 --> 00:01:44,330
Hmph. A naïve little chick, I see.

24
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:47,880
Your world is still far too small.

25
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:53,590
Because of that, the tanuki known as that girl's father
will take advantage of you as well.

26
00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:55,470
How do I win him over?

27
00:01:55,770 --> 00:01:57,330
Hell if I know.

28
00:01:57,330 --> 00:02:02,440
What are you going to do if you don't take back
the two or three girls you like on your own?

29
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,770
You spineless, cowardly baby chick.

30
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:13,860
There are such things as stars crossing paths...

31
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:15,410
Stars crossing paths?

32
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:20,480
The time when you and that girl's stars
cross paths may come someday.

33
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:25,580
Whether or not it'll happen I don't know,
I'm no astrologer.

34
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:26,330
Hey…

35
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:33,340
Indeed, polishing your skills for when that time comes
is what a naïve little chick should do.

36
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:39,300
At that moment, I felt my surging irritation go quiet.

37
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:44,100
I thought I would put my efforts
towards when that day came.

38
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:48,730
The next time we met,
I would make sure I wouldn't get torn apart.

39
00:02:49,090 --> 00:02:51,110
Thanks, old man.

40
00:02:51,540 --> 00:02:52,390
Yeah.

41
00:02:52,390 --> 00:02:53,610
Now, one more drink.

42
00:02:55,540 --> 00:03:01,270
<i>After that, all of the money I had on hand was used for alcohol,
in the name of the study of life.</i>

43
00:03:01,270 --> 00:03:04,620
<i>That day, I was once again re-educated.</i>

44
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:07,500
<i>I don't believe grown-ups.</i>

45
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,130
What do I owe you?

46
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:12,460
Don't tell me you forgot.

